  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0ae292b8-5c6d-4ab7-983a-c6390c112307-image.png\" style=\"width: 283px; height: 98px;\" /></p><p>From wavy curve, we can say&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, the function is Decreasing in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
